        "id": 1308749
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-04-03T23:22:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok, the logic for your filtering looks sound. You\u0027re only processing the interrupt on the first assertion of the corresponding fault bit.  Then you\u0027re ignoring the fault bit until it self-clears and re-asserts.",
